---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>🌍 Welcome to JJT Safaris</h1>
			
			<h3>Your Gateway to the Heart of Tanzania</h3>
			<p>
				Explore the breathtaking national parks, vibrant cities and regions, 
				stunning islands, and local sports culture across Tanzania. Use the navigation 
				bar above to dive into specific destinations and start planning your ultimate African adventure!
			</p>

			<hr />

			<h3>🦁 Breathtaking National Parks & Wildlife</h3>
			<p>
				Tanzania is home to some of the most iconic wilderness areas on earth. Whether you are looking 
				to witness the legendary Great Migration or catch a glimpse of the Big Five, our parks offer 
				unparalleled safari experiences.
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Serengeti National Park:</strong> Witness millions of wildebeest and zebras sweep across the endless savannah.</li>
				<li><strong>Ngorongoro Crater:</strong> Explore a breathtaking, self-contained volcanic caldera teeming with dense wildlife.</li>
				<li><strong>Mount Kilimanjaro:</strong> Stand at the foothills—or conquer the summit—of the tallest free-standing mountain in the world.</li>
			</ul>

			<h3>🌆 Vibrant Cities & Cultural Regions</h3>
			<p>
				Beyond the wilderness lies a rich tapestry of culture, history, and modern Tanzanian life. 
				Dive into local traditions, bustling markets, and diverse communities.
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Dar es Salaam:</strong> Feel the energetic pulse of Tanzania's major commercial hub right on the Indian Ocean.</li>
				<li><strong>Arusha:</strong> Relax in the safari capital of the country, surrounded by lush coffee plantations and Mount Meru.</li>
				<li><strong>Stone Town:</strong> Step back in time through the winding, historic labyrinth of Zanzibar's cultural heart.</li>
			</ul>

			<h3>🏝️ Stunning Tropical Islands</h3>
			<p>
				After days on the dusty safari tracks, wash off the adventure on the pristine, white-sand beaches 
				of Tanzania’s exotic archipelago.
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Zanzibar:</strong> Immerse yourself in the "Spice Island," famous for its turquoise waters, coral reefs, and rich history.</li>
				<li><strong>Pemba & Mafia Islands:</strong> Escape the crowds to find world-class diving, whale sharks, and untouched eco-resorts.</li>
			</ul>

			<h3>⚽ Passionate Local Sports Culture</h3>
			<p>
				Experience Tanzania through the eyes of its locals! Sports are the heartbeat of the community here, 
				bringing people together across every region.
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Football Fever:</strong> Feel the unmatched stadium energy of the famous Kariakoo Derby between Simba SC and Young Africans (Yanga).</li>
				<li><strong>Local Marathons:</strong> Trace the footsteps of world-class runners at the Kilimanjaro Marathon.</li>
			</ul>

			<hr />

			<h3>🗺️ Ready to Begin Your Journey?</h3>
			<p>
				Every corner of Tanzania holds a different magic. <strong>Use the navigation bar at the top of the page</strong> 
				to deep-dive into each destination, view detailed itineraries, and discover your perfect Tanzanian getaway.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
